able structures on the water.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">ICRA 2026</title><link href="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2026/icra2026/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="ICRA 2026"/><published>2026-06-08T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-06-08T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2026/icra2026</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2026/icra2026/"><![CDATA[<p>Presentation on fast motion planning for non-holonomic robots using rectangular corridors at the IEEE International Conference on Robotics and Automation (ICRA) 2026, in Vienna, Austria.</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/icra26-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/icra26-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/icra26-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/icra26.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/icra26_group-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/icra26_group-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/icra26_group-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/icra26_group.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/icra26_mit-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/icra26_mit-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/icra26_mit-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/icra26_mit.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <