nnected autonomous vehicles and intelligent transportation systems.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Presentation at ECC 2025</title><link href="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2025/ecc2025/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Presentation at ECC 2025"/><published>2025-07-24T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-07-24T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2025/ecc2025</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2025/ecc2025/"><![CDATA[<p>Presentation European Control Conference 2025, in Thessaloniki, Greece.</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/ecc2025-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/ecc2025-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/ecc2025-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/ecc2025.jpeg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="conference"/><category term="ECC"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Presentation at the European Control Conference.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Workshop Organization at MIT</title><link href="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2024/mit-ws/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Workshop Organization at MIT"/><published>2024-07-16T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2024-07-16T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2024/mit-ws</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2024/mit-ws/"><![CDATA[<p>Workshop on optimal control problems and model predictive control for autonomous systems hosted by MIT CSAIL. <a href="https://meco-group.github.io/mit-impact-2024/">Website.</a></p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/mit_workshop-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/mit_workshop-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/mit_workshop-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/mit_workshop.jpeg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="workshop"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Workshop on optimal control problems and model predictive control for autonomous systems.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Presentation at ICRA 2024</title><link href="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2024/icra2024/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Presentation at ICRA 2024"/><published>2024-05-15T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2024-05-15T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2024/icra2024</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2024/icra2024/"><![CDATA[<p>Presentation on model predictive control and control barrier functions for autonomous surface vessels at the IEEE International Conference on Robotics and Automation (ICRA) 2024, in Yokohama, Japan.</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/icra2024-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/icra2024-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/icra2024-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/icra2024.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="conference"/><category term="ICRA"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Presentation on model predictive control and control barrier functions for autonomous surface vessels at IEEE ICRA 2024.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Talk at TU Delft</title><link href="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2024/delft-talk/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Talk at TU Delft"/><published>2024-04-16T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2024-04-16T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2024/delft-talk</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2024/delft-talk/"><![CDATA[<p>Talk at Delft University of Technology about some of my previous and current research work, and what we do in the MECO Research Team at KU Leuven. I focused on the subjects of robust control and fast optimal motion planning, and their application to single and multi-agent autonomous systems in water, air and ground.</p> <p>Thanks to Elia Trevisan and Prof. Javier Alonso-Mora for the invitation and tour around the lab, and for facilitating discussions with plenty of researchers working on similar topics.</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/talk_tudelft-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/talk_tudelft-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/talk_tudelft-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/talk_tudelft.jpeg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="talk"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Talk on past research and work at MECO.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Presentation at ICRA 2023</title><link href="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2023/icra2023/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Presentation at ICRA 2023"/><published>2023-06-01T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2023-06-01T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2023/icra2023</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://alexglzg.github.io/blog/2023/icra2023/"><![CDATA[<p>Presentation on deep reinforcement learning for autonomous surface vessels at the IEEE International Conference on Robotics and Automation (ICRA) 2023 in London, England.</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/icra2023-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/icra2023-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/icra2023-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/icra2023.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="conference"/><category term="ICRA"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Presentation on deep reinforcement learning for autonomous surface vessels at IEEE ICRA 2023.]]></summary></entry></feed>